# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter. [[cite:obs-faec8665589718f0123ad72bf68622464b167adf "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The annex specifies the ordinary contribution amount: Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-2de569fecb987fd10a932e64a08333894ebee168 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
